# babacan.me - local environment (example)
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN is used ONLY by the prebuild step (scripts/fetch-github-data.js)
# to raise the GitHub API rate limit. It is never shipped to the browser.
# A classic token with the public_repo scope is enough; no token is required
# for public data.
#
# Do NOT use a VITE_-prefixed name for this token: Vite exposes VITE_* variables
# to client code, which would leak the token to every visitor.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
